ability, content or policies.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>This website may display third-party advertisements. Advertising providers may use cookies or similar technologies as described in the Privacy Policy. Ads must not be mistaken for editorial recommendations.</p><h2>Changes and contact</h2><p>We may update these terms as the website changes. Continued use after an update means you are using the site under the revised terms. For questions, use the <a href=\"https://wishly.bd/contact\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wishly contact page</a>.</p></article></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n      <div class=\"premium-container\">\n        <div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n          <div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n            <a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n              <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n            </a>\n            <p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n            <a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost footer-main-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Main Wishly website ↗</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"/guides/\">All guides</a><a href=\"/topics/love-and-romance/\">Love &amp; romance</a><a href=\"/topics/emotional-support/\">Emotional support</a><a href=\"/topics/communication-and-repair/\">Communication &amp; repair</a><a href=\"/topics/long-distance-relationships/\">Long-distance</a><a href=\"/topics/special-occasions/\">Special occasions</a><a href=\"/topics/friendship-and-gratitude/\">Friendship &amp; gratitude</a><a href=\"/features/\">Wishly features</a><a href=\"/faq/\">Frequently asked</a><a href=\"/about/\">About Wishly</a></div>\